WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.340
Two standing-desk brands tied on mentions.

00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:05.100
Every comparison still picked the same winner.

00:00:05.340 --> 00:00:07.700
In Recoscope’s November 18 snapshot,

00:00:08.300 --> 00:00:12.600
UPLIFT and FlexiSpot each appeared in 11 of 12 usable answers

00:00:12.600 --> 00:00:15.700
across four AI assistants and three prompt types.

00:00:16.140 --> 00:00:19.120
But all four comparative answers ranked UPLIFT first

00:00:19.120 --> 00:00:20.540
and FlexiSpot second.

00:00:20.940 --> 00:00:25.080
In the under-$600 answers, FlexiSpot appeared in all four.

00:00:25.480 --> 00:00:28.420
UPLIFT appeared in three, sometimes at a base price

00:00:28.420 --> 00:00:29.100
near the cap.

00:00:29.100 --> 00:00:31.840
A mention doesn’t verify the checkout total.

00:00:32.100 --> 00:00:36.540
On November 10, both brands appeared in 10 of 11 usable answers.

00:00:36.880 --> 00:00:39.840
Coverage differs, so this isn’t evidence of growth.

00:00:40.200 --> 00:00:42.360
Mention frequency and comparative rank

00:00:42.360 --> 00:00:44.440
are separate measures of captured answers,

00:00:44.720 --> 00:00:45.800
not product quality.

00:00:46.160 --> 00:00:48.920
Explore benchmark at getrecoscope.com.
